        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Does calling `:edit` fix those cases? Full snippet:\r\n\r\n```lua\r\nlocal b = vim.fn.bufadd(vim.fs.normalize(path))\r\nvim.cmd.buffer(b)\r\nvim.cmd.edit()\r\n```\r\n\r\nThen perhaps that should be the guidance.",
